		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[March 17, 2011, Abu Dhabi, UAE:

NYU Abu Dhabi, through its NYU Abu Dhabi Institute, hopes to establish itself as one of the premiere academic centers of the middle east. In its first year, the campus has plans to expand its presence in Abu Dhabi, the UAE, and hopefully the region, thanks in large part to a large endowment given to the university by the UAE government.

The NYU logo is seen on the side of a campus building in downtown Abu Dhabi. Popping out of the background is the minaret of the mosque located across the parking lot of the campus. 

///Lee Hoagland for The New York Times///]]></content:encoded>
