<div style="max-width: 550px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.2em; line-height: 1.5em;">
<h1>Thank You for Subscribing</h1>
<p>We have sent an email confirmation to the address you specified.</p>

<p><strong>Please make sure to click the "Yes, subscribe me to the list" link in the email you just received.</strong></p>

