	<item>
		<title>Abu Dhabi Sandstorm on Social Media</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=104201</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 04 Apr 2015 19:11:53 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Hennie Ward]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.thegazelle.org/?p=104201</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[Thursday saw a deluge of social media posts depicting the sandstorm that hit Abu Dhabi and the surrounding area. See our picks of the some of the best pictures and captions from students and faculty in this slideshow.

[slideshow][Photo by Sala Shaker/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_1.jpg);[Photo by Zsofia Sveiczer/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_2.jpg);[Photo by Nikolai Kozak/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_3.jpg);[Photo by Laura Evans/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_4.jpg);[Photo by Brooks Fowler/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_5.jpg);[Photo by Alyssa Ferreira/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_6.jpg);[Photo by Keriana Rennie/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_7.jpg);[Photo by Osama Salman/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_8.jpg);[Photo by Mateo Juvera Molina/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_9.jpg);[Photo by Arianna Stucki/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_10.jpg);[Photo by Angela Orozco/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_11.jpg);[Photo by James Carrington Gardner/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm_12.jpg);[Photo by Bryan Waterman/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_04_Features_Sandstorm13.jpg)[/slideshow]

&nbsp;

<em>Mariko Kuroda is design director and <span style="color: #000000;">Hennie Ward is social media editor. Email them at </span>feedback@gzl.me.</em>

&nbsp;]]></content:encoded>
