	<item>
		<title>Hannahreference</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=106731</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 30 Nov -0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Zoe Hu]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.thegazelle.org/?p=106731</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<ul class="nav nav-tabs" style="width: 80%; margin: auto;">
	<li class="active"><a href="#delivery" data-toggle="tab">Food Delivery</a></li>
	<li><a href="#damage" data-toggle="tab">Damage Control</a></li>
	<li><a href="#campus" data-toggle="tab">Campus Contacts</a></li>
	<li><a href="#beauty" data-toggle="tab">Beauty and Wellness</a></li>
</ul>
<div class="tab-content" style="height: inherit; width: 80%; margin: auto;">
<div id="managing" class="tab-pane fade active in">
<div class="media"><a class="pull-left" style="padding: 0 4%;" href="#">
</a>
<div class="media-body" style="padding-top: 3%;">

<h4 class="media-heading">Lebanese</h4>
Try <a href="http://foodonclick.com/abudhabi-food-delivery/mora-tourist-club-area">Mora </a>for great, cheap lebanese and no delivery fee!

Alternatively, <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/maroosh-tourist-club-area-al-zahiyah">Maroosh </a>is an NYUAD classic. Call at 02 643 0525.

<h4 class="media-heading">Afghani</h4>
For the highly praised <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/nolus-downtown-al-maryah-island">Nolu Downtown</a>, you can call at 02 644 1516. 

<h4 class="media-heading">Thai</h4>
Call <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/lemongrass-thai-restaurant-al-maryah-island">Lemongrass </a>at 02 677 0100.

Alternatively, <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/stars-cloves-mussafah">Stars & Cloves</a> has spring rolls and fried rice to order at 02 5517227.

<h4 class="media-heading">Sushi</h4>
One of the few sushi places that delivers to Saadiyat, <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/sushi-central-al-mina">Sushi Central</a> is just a phone call away at 04 4409322, ext. 124.

<h4 class="media-heading">Egyptian</h4>
Try something different with <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/altekia-al-markaziya">Altekia </a>at 02 6786788.

<h4 class="media-heading">Indian</h4>
Need your butter chicken fix?
Call <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/qaser-al-ekram-madinat-zayed">Al Ekram</a> at 02 639 8000 and the comfort will come to you. Minimum delivery 150dhs.

Also, more Indian food at <a href="http://www.talabat.com/ae/en/menu/1448/1565/kababs-n-kurries-al-markaziyah">Kababs & Kurries</a> at 02 628 2522.

<h4 class="media-heading">Saj</h4>
Zaatar, labneh, meat - your choice. Call <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/saj-hut-al-khalidiya/menu#tabtop">Saj Hut</a> at 02 6216217.

<h4 class="media-heading">Burgers</h4>
<a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/burger-bureau-yas-island/menu">Burger Bureau</a> at 02 5641090. Prices hover around 30 AED.

You'll find a veggie option and shakes at <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/burgerfuel-al-maryah-island">Burger Fuel</a> - just dial 02 6738779.

<h4 class="media-heading">Pizza</h4>
For when you're sick of Pizza Hut, call <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/800pizza-al-reem-island">800 Pizza</a> at 800 74992. 

Or check out <a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/il-forno-al-khalidiya">Il Forno</a>, which has a large variety of options for toppings. Plus, garlic bread. Call at 04 4409322, ext. 189.

<h4 class="media-heading">Deli Food</h4>
<a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/bloomsburys-al-mushrif/menu">Bloomsbury's</a> at 02 4914537 will get you croissants, breakfast platters and some cheaper sandwich options.

<a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/ortegos-deli-al-markaziya/photos">Ortego's Deli</a> has some fare with an Asian twist. Call at 02 6770740.

<strong>Dessert:</strong>
<a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/wafflemeister-al-wahda/menu">Wafflemeister</a> at 02 6417949 offers toppings like chocolate, strawberries and marshmallows.  

<h4 class="media-heading">2 a.m. food</h4>
In a finals week spiral and looking for something to get you through it? Or do you just really like fried chicken? Call <a href="http://www.kfc-arabia.com/">KFC </a>at 600 522252. 

If you're in the mood for something else, try <a href="http://www.pizzahut-me.com/">Pizza Hut</a> at 600 569999. Numbers that every NYUAD student should have.</p>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="damage" class="tab-pane fade in">
<div class="media"><a class="pull-left" style="padding: 0 4%;" href="#">
<div class="media-body" style="padding-top: 3%;">
<h4 class="media-heading">What it is</h4>
<p dir="ltr" style="padding-right: 8%;">
Dropped your phone? Spilled your midnight latte on your laptop? Have no fear, there’s <a href="http://www.yellowpages-uae.com/uae/abu-dhabi/computer-repairs-and-maintenance">somewhere</a> on Hamdan that can help you out.  </p>

<h4 class="media-heading">Medical services</h4>
Need a typhoid vaccine for a trip? Will Health and Wellness not fill your prescription anymore? New Medical Center takes our insurance.
NMC Hospital: 02 633 2255
NMC pharmacy: 02 617 9820  </p>

<h4 class="media-heading">Travel troubles</h4>
Are you lost at the airport? Flight delayed for a week? Call the NYUAD immigration team: 971 50 642 3212 </p>

<h4 class="media-heading">Citibank</h4>
Wondering where your stipend went? Forgot your personal pin? 
For Citibank help call: 971 600 5 41114  </p>

<h4 class="media-heading">Cabs</h4>
Save these numbers for cab service in Abu Dhabi and Dubai. Both have options for women’s only taxis! Call 600535353 for Abu Dhabi and 04 2080000 for Dubai. </p>

<h4 class="media-heading">Off-campus dry-cleaning</h4>
If you're dry-cleaning in a rush, there’s a place at the St Regis, Jeeves Dry Cleaning. Open 8:00am-11:00pm daily. Call 050 668 1167. </p>

<h4 class="media-heading">Parents visiting</h4>
If you have family coming and have no idea where to take them, think about a desert safari?  One reliable company is Green Land Tourism at 055 4999 028 — join GroupOn first, though. There's most likely a deal.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
