	<item>
		<title>Artist: Anna Kurkova</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=115991</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 30 Nov -0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Laura Waltje]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.thegazelle.org/?p=115991</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[Anna Kurkova's capstone in visual arts was selected to be published as part of an ongoing initiative, run by The Gazelle's Creative Desk, to create a space for student artwork. If you'd like to learn more about this week's artist, check out the podcast interview, which was conducted, produced and edited by creative editor Laura Waltje.

[powerpress channel="creative"]

[caption id="attachment_116001" align="alignnone" width="784"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/10842287_987130834638783_17976942917010869_o.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-116001" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/10842287_987130834638783_17976942917010869_o-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova" width="784" height="522" /></a> photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_116041" align="alignnone" width="784"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11206624_987133047971895_5866957690125047511_o.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-116041" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11206624_987133047971895_5866957690125047511_o-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova" width="784" height="522" /></a> photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_116031" align="alignnone" width="783"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11203677_987131654638701_6424004095061821505_o.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-116031" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11203677_987131654638701_6424004095061821505_o-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova" width="783" height="521" /></a> photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_116021" align="alignnone" width="786"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11194508_987130374638829_443287675931188513_o.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-116021" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11194508_987130374638829_443287675931188513_o-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova" width="786" height="523" /></a> photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_116011" align="alignnone" width="783"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11146398_987132941305239_7037468425770258987_o.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-116011" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/11146398_987132941305239_7037468425770258987_o-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova" width="783" height="521" /></a> photo courtesy of Anna Kurkova[/caption]

&nbsp;

The Creative Desk publishes works selected by a rotating panel. We are looking for prose, poetry, photography, film, visual arts, music and more. Send your creative work to ljw296@nyu.edu. Submissions accepted on a rolling basis.

<em>This week's artwork was selected by creative editor Laura Johanna Waltje, deputy creative editor Rabha Ashry, Roshni Dadlani, Nia Wilson and Helina Yigletu. </em><em>Email them at feedback@gzl.me.</em>

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;]]></content:encoded>
