	<item>
		<title>Andres Rodriguez</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=121</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 09 Feb 2013 18:54:43 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Maitha Al Mansoori]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/andres-rodriguez-platform</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>The past student government did a very good job at legitimizing itself both in front of the administration and the student body. As vice president, I hope to build on that legitimacy aiming to create a student government that addresses the needs of students and provides a voice for students to the administration and community. I along the future student government wish to keep promoting campaigns that facilitate the students' involvement in the Abu Dhabi community, community service programs and environmental efforts.</p><p>
After working in the parliamentary advisory board I have also realized a want for increase transparency in the decision making of the government and its committees and would thus make it a priority to increase communications with interested students as to how and why decisions are made at the government level and staff level if and when possible.</p>]]></content:encoded>
