		<title>Angelina Micha Djaja</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=151</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 09 Feb 2013 19:02:36 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Amanda Randone2]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/angelina-micha-djaja-platform</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>Hi, my name is Angelina Micha Djaja and I am running for treasurer. Having performed
various leadership roles in the past, I believe I possess the communication and organizational skills required for this position. I want to take advantage of the fact that our school is in its developing stages; this is the time when we can make change. I want to not only provide you with opportunities but also work with you to ensure your success. I hope to uphold a standard of utmost honesty and transparency with students and administration. I am not one to simply stick to my role in the team. I will constantly reach out to my colleagues, whether to support, collaborate, or to receive help. The process of funding should be clear, simple, and easily accessible. I will make sure that the budget goes towards the best interests of the student body, that it will be used efficiently to maximize its potential. In my term, I will also consider our approaching move to Saadiyat and pave the way for a smooth transition. My positive and detail-oriented mindset gives me confidence that I have acquired the accountability to manage your student government’s finances. Thank you!</p>]]></content:encoded>
