	<item>
		<title>Geo Kamus</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=161</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 09 Feb 2013 19:04:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Amanda Randone2]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/geo-kamus-platform</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>Hi, my name is Geo Kamus, and I am running for your Student Government Senator. The Senator’s principal responsibility is to make and maintain connections not only within the Global Network University, but also with the diverse communities outside our school. Having been involved with various groups inside and outside NYU Abu Dhabi, I am confident that I can fulfill the responsibilities expected of this position.</p><p>
As an intern in the Community Outreach Office, I work closely with many of our staff across several departments. This has prepared me to facilitate discussions between the student body and the administration regarding concerns that may arise. I will also be able to coordinate mutual goals between both parties, particularly with strengthening our relationship with local universities in the UAE. There are many opportunities to interact with and be a part of a larger community, opportunities that I am very excited to explore and initiate, especially because our school is new.</p><p>
It would be my honor to represent the school as your Senator this term and be part of building a school that continues to redefine traditional perceptions of community into something more inclusive, and more impactful.</p>]]></content:encoded>
