	<item>
		<title>Irene Pañeda</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=301</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 09 Feb 2013 19:45:13 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Nathaniel B. Chumley]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/irene-paneda-platform</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>As a junior class representative I hope to serve the best interests of the Class of 2014. Given that our class is currently studying in different locations around the world, I would like to work to keep the connectedness and the sense of community within our class. The nature of our university allows us to take on the unique opportunity of studying abroad up to two semesters. Nevertheless, this can affect the creation of a cohesive community back in AD. As a class representative I believe my task should be to work towards making every junior feel included into NYUAD and make their concerns, ideas, comments and proposals be heard.</p>]]></content:encoded>
