	<item>
		<title>Otto Kakhidze</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=191</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 09 Feb 2013 19:54:47 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Julia Saubier]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/otto-kakhidze</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>On an archeological excavation near the border between Armenia and Georgia, presidential candidate Otto Kakhidze recalled, with sheer fervor, excavating two teeth of a medieval pig.
</p><p>Kakhidze’s intellectual curiosities manifest in his excavations with the National Museum of Georgia and also permeate his social interactions. He spent nights of his freshman Marhaba week caught up in philosophical debates with his new peers. It is difficult to find students whose academic drive stems from a genuine love for learning; this special quality exists in Kakhidze &mdash; a true academic.
</p><p>But many NYUAD students are privy to the other sides of Kakhidze’s multifaceted character. He is a published poet, equestrian, capoeirista, hiker and rugby player. His extensive interests and passion for cultures are what make him approachable. He was active in student government as School Prefect in Scotland and as class representative last year. In Georgia, he founded the local chapter of the European Youth Parliament, which gave him the opportunity to dance the chicken dance alongside former French President, Nicolas Sarkozy. Kakhidze’s achievements as a leader are not going unrecognized, as he will receive the prestigious “Duke of Edinburgh’s International Award” this summer.
 </p><p>Kakhidze prides himself in managing to entrench a core universal value in his ever-evolving psyche — that of the responsibility to “love every human being.” This Georgian man has a lot of love to give, and with his unrelenting perseverance and sincerity, Kakhidze continues to let this value system persist in the unique community that is NYUAD. And despite all that Kakhidze has accomplished, his biggest achievement may be his ability to make others laugh.</p>]]></content:encoded>
