	<item>
		<title>Otto Kakhidze</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=201</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 09 Feb 2013 19:54:24 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Julia Saubier]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/otto-kakhidze-platform</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>Apart from being maximally approachable, supportive, and highly responsible, major priorities of the president of the student government should include the following:
</p><p>
<ul> <li>Encouraging the integration between freshmen, sophomores and juniors in order to form a cohesive multicultural student body;
</li><li>Addressing problems considering the interests of not only the community but the individuals;
</li><li>Promotion of cultural, academic and sporting projects collaborating with the local community;
</li></ul>
</p><p>
Given my two years experience as an active member of the student body and one of the first class of 2015 representatives, I believe I can contribute more in the process of building the NYUAD community.</p>]]></content:encoded>
