	<item>
		<title>Morgante Pell</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=321</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 09 Feb 2013 19:52:03 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Nina Bayatti]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/morgante-pell-platform</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>It would be a joy to serve as the alternate senator for the student government. I believe that Student Interest Groups serve as the heart of our community and would love to support their mission as the alternate senator. Through clear communication and helpful organization, I will be able to build on the mission of NYUAD: that together, through mutual understanding and exchange, we can create a world-class university and a global family. For my first semester, I already contributed to this community by attending every General Assembly and creating a number of new student services for the Research & Development committee, including our new Spotify account. If elected, I hope to build on that work and look forward to drawing on my 6 years of student government experience to encourage transparency, frank communication, and new services for SIGs and students alike. </p>]]></content:encoded>
