		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://web.thegazelle.org/angela-ortega-pastor-platform</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<br /><p>If elected Student Government Treasurer I commit myself to handle my responsibilities to
the best of my capacity, always giving the most of me, with enthusiasm, care, rationale and integrity. To which I can add my experience in the field as I have been previously elected to carry similar duties as President of Student Council in high school and treasurer for the NYUAD Economics and Finance Club. One of the richness’s of our community is its broad range of interests, the ultimate expression of it is the numerous SIGs, as a member of various of these
I believe I understand their needs in terms of funding and it would thus be an honor for me to take it a step further and be part of the enrichment process of our community through the post of Student Government Treasurer.</p>]]></content:encoded>
