	<item>
		<title>Lens: The Streets of Abu Dhabi</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=10531</link>
		<pubDate>Sun, 15 Sep 2013 01:52:47 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Asyrique Asyraf Thevendran]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.thegazelle.org/?p=10531</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[[caption id="attachment_10821" align="alignnone" width="600"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140142.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10821" alt="P9140142" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140142-600x337.jpg" width="600" height="337" /></a> <em>A sign denoting First St. </em>[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_10871" align="alignnone" width="600"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140129.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10871" alt="P9140129" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140129-600x337.jpg" width="600" height="337" /></a> <em>An entrance to a Central Souk car park</em>[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_10841" align="alignnone" width="600"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140137.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10841" alt="P9140137" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140137-600x337.jpg" width="600" height="337" /></a> <em>Electra St. and Sheikh Zayed the First St. intersection</em>[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_10911" align="alignnone" width="600"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/Lens-4.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10911" alt="OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/Lens-4-600x337.jpg" width="600" height="337" /></a> <em>A stretch of Corniche Rd at three a.m.</em>[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_10831" align="alignnone" width="600"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140141.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10831" alt="P9140141" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140141-600x337.jpg" width="600" height="337" /></a> <em>Sheikh Zayed the First St. at dusk</em>[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_10901" align="alignnone" width="600"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140130.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10901" alt="P9140130" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/P9140130-600x337.jpg" width="600" height="337" /></a> <em>An underpass beneath Central Souk</em>[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_10891" align="alignnone" width="600"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/Lens-5.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-10891" alt="OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/09/Lens-5-600x1066.jpg" width="600" height="1066" /></a> <em>Traffic lights at Seventh St. </em>[/caption]

