		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/05/Gazellecartoon_11_24_Nino.jpg"><img alt="Cartoon by Nino Cricco/The Gazelle" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2013/05/Gazellecartoon_11_24_Nino.jpg" width="843" height="224" /></a>

