		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<style type="text/css">
#article .row-content video {
display:none;
}
#outer-box {
width: 942px;
margin-left:-61px;
font-family:"Lato", Arial, sans-serif;
}
.candidate-grid {
max-width:100%;
padding:0px;
list-style: none;
text-align: center;
margin: 0 auto;
}

.candidate-grid li {
width:226px;
height:17em;
margin:0.5%;
background: #000;
color: #fff;
display: block;
float: left;
padding: 1.6em;
/*cursor: pointer;*/
position: relative;
}

#article .row-content .candidate-grid-pic {
position:absolute;
height: 100%;
width: 100%;
margin: -9.5% 0 0 -50%;
}

#article .row-content .candidate-big-pic img {
max-width: 200px;
margin-top:2%;
width:40%;
}

.candidate-position {
font-size: 1.5em;
font-weight: 700;
}

.candidate-position span {
font-weight: 100;
}

.candidate-class {
font-size: 3em;
font-weight: 100;
}

.candidate-text {
margin: 1.5% 31% 0 31%;
font-size:1.1em;
}

.candidate-name {
position: absolute;
font-size: 2em;
opacity: 0.5;
transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
}

.candidate-close {
position: absolute;
top: 0.4em;
right: 0.4em;
width: 2em;
height: 2em;
text-indent: -9000px;
cursor: pointer;
z-index: 1000;
}

.candidate-close:before {
content: 'x';
font-weight: 100;
position: absolute;
top: 0;
left: 0;
width: 100%;
height: 100%;
font-size: 5em;
line-height: 0.6;
text-align: center;
text-indent: 0px;
}

.candidate-profile {
width:100%;
height:100%
}

.candidate-overlay {
background-color:rgb(41, 41, 41);
opacity: 0;
position: fixed;
top: 0;
left: 0;
width: 100%;
height: 100%;
transition: all 0.4s ease;
z-index: -1;
pointer-events: none;
cursor: default;
}

.candidate-full-name {
font-size: 3em;
margin-top:1%;
}

.candidate-grid li:hover .candidate-name {
opacity:1;
}

#robert-outer-name {
margin-left:-19%;
top:83%;
}

#lex-outer-name {
margin-left:-26%;
top:83%;
}
#corey-outer-name {
margin-left:-16%;
top:83%;
}
#hamel-outer-name {
margin-left:-19%;
top:83%;
}
#alex-outer-name {
margin-left:-14%;
top:83%;
}
#benjamin-outer-name {
margin-left:-24%;
top:83%;
}
#khadidja-outer-name {
margin-left:-22%;
top:83%;
}
#olivia-outer-name {
margin-left:-15%;
top:83%;
}
#yuqi-outer-name {
margin-left:-14%;
top:83%;
}
#andrew-outer-name {
margin-left:-21%;
top:83%;
}
#keeryung-outer-name {
margin-left:-25%;
top:83%;
}

@media screen and (max-width:1200px) {#outer-box {width: 700px;margin-left:26px;}}
@media screen and (max-width:992px) {#outer-box {margin-left:-14%;}.candidate-text {margin: 1.5% 12% 0 12%;}}
@media screen and (max-width:768px) {#outer-box {width: 464px;margin-left: 15%;}}
@media screen and (max-width:500px) {#outer-box {width: 90%;margin: 0 9%;}.candidate-full-name {font-size: 2.5em;}
</style>	<link href="http://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Lato:100,400,700" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" />

<script type="text/javascript" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/thegazelle/css-js/38/modernizr.custom.js"></script>

<div id="outer-box">
<ul class="candidate-grid clearfix" id="candidate-grid">
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/Corey-final-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="corey-outer-name">Corey</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/COREY.C-500x500.png" /></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Corey Meyer</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> President</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Corey Meyer is currently studying in Abu Dhabi. He has previously served two terms as vice president. Meyer has also served as a chair on the Representative Committee for Academic Divisions and a student representative on the Faculty Council. In his platform Meyer says, “I will continue increasing transparency by publicizing decisions and discussions of the Executive Board and by facilitating more opportunities for input and votes by the General Assembly.”</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/HAMEL-FINAL-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="hamel-outer-name">Hamel</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/HAMEL.C-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Hamel Al-Qubaisi</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> President</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Hamel Al-Qubaisi is currently studying in London. Al-Qubaisi said that his priority is reducing any bureaucratic barriers to student involvement in General Assemblies. Al-Qubaisi said, “Careers and further education are of my greatest concerns. Working closely with the administration and the CDC, we will put all our efforts to further achieve higher results in terms of graduate school opportunities and employment, especially at the local level.”</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/lex-peel-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="lex-outer-name">Alexander</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/lex-peel-circle-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Alexander Hamilton Peel</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> Vice President</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Alexander Peel is a former class representative. Peel stated that he aimed to tackle the larger issues, such as the core curriculum, graduation requirements, capstones and study abroad while also focusing on smaller-scale problems. Peel said that he aims to improve “communication between the student government and the community at large.”</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/ALEX-NYIKOS-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="alex-outer-name">Alex</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/alex-nyikos-circle-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Alex Nyikos</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> Vice President</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Former treasurer Alex Nyikos is running for Vice President. Nyikos said that he would focus on further implementing Yalla, clarifying capstone requirements and improving the responsiveness and effectiveness of committees by empowering committee chairs.</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/ben-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="benjamin-outer-name">Benjamin</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/BEN.C-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Benjamin Jance IV</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span>Global Vice President</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Benjamin Jance is currently studying in Abu Dhabi and former officer of external affairs. Jance stressed that his previous experience in the Global Issues Network conference as well as Hall Council would give him the necessary background to be an effective Global Vice President. Jance also highlighted his experience in working on creating the Global Student Council.</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/KHADIDJA-FINAL-465x500.jpg" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="khadidja-outer-name">Khadidja</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/khadidja-circle-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Khadidja Dehbi</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2017</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span>Officer for External Affairs</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Khadidja Dehbi is running for the Officer for External Affairs. Dehbi wanted to create more opportunities to connect NYUAD students with local Emirati students. Dehbi said, “My hope is to see NYUAD become a part of the fabric of the community and Abu Dhabi so that our student body is exposed to new windows and avenues to engage and expand.”</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/olivia-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="olivia-outer-name">Olivia</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/olivia-circle-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Olivia Bergen</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> Officer of Communications</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Olivia Bergen is currently studying away in Washington, D.C. Bergen highlighted two main areas in which she would work, student concerns and increasing accountability.</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/robert-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="robert-outer-name">Robert</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/robert-circle-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Robert Moroch</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> Treasurer</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Robert Moroch is currently studying away in London. If elected Treasurer, Moroch said, “It will be my pleasure to work towards shaping the university in a way which addresses both the needs and concerns of students.”</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/yuki-.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="yuqi-outer-name">Yuqi</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/yuki-circle.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Yuqi Sun</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> Treasurer</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Yuqi Sun is currently studying away in New York. Sun said, “I will promote efficiency in this administration by facilitating more cooperation between SIG’s, university academic departments and external parties, building upon efforts of previous treasurers.” Sun also stressed his previous experience in preparing business and financial reports.</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/PITTS-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="andrew-outer-name">Andrew</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/PITTS-CIRCLE-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Andrew Pitts</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> Officer of Student Activities</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Andrew Pitts is currently studying in Abu Dhabi. Pitts pointed to his experience working with the Campus Life Facilities Office and leading a Student Interest Group as evidence of his suitability for this office.</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
	<li><img class="candidate-grid-pic" alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/keeryung-465x500.png" /> <span class="candidate-name" id="keeryung-outer-name">Keeryung</span>
<div class="candidate-overlay"><span class="candidate-close">close</span>
<div class="candidate-profile">
<div><span class="candidate-big-pic"><img alt="" src="https://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/02/keeryung-circle-500x500.png" /></span></div>
<div class="candidate-full-name">Keeryung Kim</div>
<div><span class="candidate-class">2015</span></div>
<div class="candidate-position"><span>Running for:</span> Officer of Student Activities</div>
<div class="candidate-text">Keeryung Kim is currently studying in Berlin. Kim wanted to improve communication between the budget committee and SIG leaders, hold a pre-SIG fair orientation for freshmen, increase SIG accountability and require SIG’s to be more realistic in their planned activities.</div>
<div></div>
</div>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>

