		<title>In Photos: Freshmen Take on Spring Break</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=103751</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 04 Apr 2015 19:05:53 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Kristina Stankovic]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.thegazelle.org/?p=103751</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[[slideshow][The Netherlands — Photo by Nikolaj Nielsen/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_The-Netherlands-Nikolaj-Nielsen.jpg);[Finland — Photo by Anastasija Stojcevska/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_MUN-Finland-Anastasija-Stojcevska.jpg);[Sri Lanka — Photo by Hazem Ibrahim — The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_Sri-Lanka-Hazem-Ibrahim.jpg);[The UAE — Photo by Alexander Burlin/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04-04_Features_SB_Dubai-Alexander-Burlin.jpg);[Lebanon — Photo by Kristina Stankovic/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_Beirut-Kristina-Stankovic.jpg);[The UAE — Photo by Mark Surnin/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_Abu-Dhabi-Mark-Surnin.jpg);[Indonesia — Photo by Kate-Melville-Rea/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_Bali-Kate-Melville-Rea-.jpg);[Czech Republic — Photo by Andrija Klaric/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_Prague-Andrija-Klaric.jpg);[Sri Lanka — Photo by Kelly Murphy/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_Sri-Lanka-Kelly-Murphy.jpg);[India — Photo by Dana Abu Ali/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2014/11/04_04_Features_SB_India-Dana-Abu-Ali.jpg);[/slideshow]

Curious what NYU Abu Dhabi's freshmen got up to over spring break?

Despite the slump of post-midterm exhaustion, travel culture is still alive and well at NYUAD — especially among its newest class. Whether it's a group excursion to Prague or a Model UN conference in Finland, your fellow frequent flyers passed their first university spring break in unique and varied ways.

If you're a senior who spent the vacation back on Saadiyat, wrangling with an unwieldy capstone, these freshmen exploits may have you feeling some serious travel-envy.

<em><span style="color: #000000;">Kristina Stankovic compiled this photo essay. Email her at </span>feedback@gzl.me.</em>]]></content:encoded>
