		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/EM2A1wrvM9E" width="853" height="480" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe>

<em>This video contains explicit language. </em>

Artist's note:

Over the last semester, I have dedicated myself to answering questions regarding Illuminati involvement in NYU, and in the world at large. Earlier in the semester, an accomplice and I launched a <a href="http://www.thegazelle.org/issue/57/news/iluminati/">poster campaign</a> highlighting Illuminati involvement on campus.

In March, I directed a film entitled <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=trXsF4bGIQI">NYUMINATI</a>, once again calling into question Illuminati infiltration into NYU Abu Dhabi. One of the biggest discoveries in the making of that film however, was the undeniable signals towards Tanzania.

If I truly wanted my questions answered, I knew I would have to organize an expedition to the heart of illuminati influence, and this is precisely what I did.

The following video, following the Tanzanian expedition, will be my last Illuminati-related work of art. It concludes a search for the truth that I long ago set out on, and I hope it gives NYUAD students the peace of mind they deserve."

<em>The editors of The Gazelle have decided to publish this video outside of regular Creative Desk schedule due to the critical nature of new leads on the Illuminati  investigation. </em>

Usually, the Creative Desk publishes works selected by a rotating panel. We are looking for prose, poetry, photography, film, visual arts, music and more. Send your creative work to ljw296@nyu.edu. Submissions accepted on a rolling basis.]]></content:encoded>
