4/04_11_Features_ArabNight17.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight18.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight19.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight20.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight21.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight22.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight23.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight24.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu and Joey Bui/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/04_11_Features_ArabNight25.jpg)[/slideshow]

The university's Arab Culture Club held the year's first and only Arab Culture Night on April 11, in which students aimed to share food, dance, poetry and music from the Arab world with the wider Abu Dhabi community. Click through for a slideshow of photos from the night.

<em>Zoe Hu and Joey Bui are editors-in-chief. Email them at feedback@gzl.me.</em>]]></content:encoded>
