		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[Sarah Bushra's work was selected to be published as part of an ongoing initiative, run by The Gazelle's Creative Desk, to create a space for student artwork.  This week we are featuring Sarah's curatorial capstone, <em>Topography of a Parallel Universe</em>. If you'd like to learn more about this week's artist, check out the podcast interview, which was conducted, produced and edited by creative editor Laura Waltje.

[powerpress channel="creative"]
<p><em>Update (April 25 2015): This podcast was updated to adjust the sound quality for better listening. The original file can be downloaded <a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/thegazelle/creative-podcasts/2015/EP7-TheGazelleCreative-SarahBushra.mp3">here</a>.</em></p>

[caption id="attachment_109561" align="alignnone" width="789"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/MG_1397.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-109561" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/MG_1397-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo by Joi Lee" width="789" height="525" /></a>Photo courtesy of Joi Lee[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_109571" align="alignnone" width="790"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/MG_1440.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-109571" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/MG_1440-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo by Joi Lee" width="790" height="525" /></a>Photo courtesy of Joi Lee[/caption]

[caption id="attachment_109611" align="alignnone" width="790"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/MG_1293.jpg"><img class=" wp-image-109611" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/04/MG_1293-1600x1066.jpg" alt="photo by Joi Lee" width="790" height="526" /></a>Photo courtesy of Joi Lee[/caption]

