		<content:encoded><![CDATA[[slideshow][Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/02/05_02_News_Wedding1.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/02/05_02_News_Wedding2.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/02/05_02_News_Wedding3.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/02/05_02_News_Wedding5.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/02/05_02_News_Wedding6.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/02/05_02_News_Wedding7.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/02/05_02_News_Wedding8.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0046.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0057.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0059.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0064.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0088.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0091.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0157.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0161.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0168.jpg);[Photo by Zoe Hu/The Gazelle](http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/05/DSC_0177.jpg)[/slideshow]

Wrists laced with flowers and plates loaded with food were two common sights at the West Forum on Saturday, where the university's Pakistan Student Association hosted an event commonly reserved for students' summer vacations and trips back home: a wedding. Sharing in the traditions of marriage in Pakistan, students, faculty and staff gathered for mock matrimony to witness dances, singing, henna and a buffet table heaping with biryani. Above are some of the stand-out photos of the night. 

<em>Zoe Hu is editor-in-chief. Email her at feedback@gzl.me.</em>]]></content:encoded>
