		<content:encoded><![CDATA[[caption id="attachment_123761" align="aligncenter" width="2013"]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/09/UWC.jpg"><img src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/09/UWC.jpg" alt="Graphic by Megan Eloise/The Gazelle" width="2013" height="997" class="size-full wp-image-123761" /></a> Graphic by Megan Eloise/The Gazelle[/caption]
