		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.thegazelle.org/?p=127591</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[&nbsp;<iframe width="853" height="480" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Yfzwksf1BH8" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>

The Gazelle Video Desk's 12 hour exploration of Abu Dhabi: a brief introduction and suggested itinerary for Abu Dhabi residents, new and old alike.

Click on the places below for the maps of their location.

<a href="https://www.google.ae/maps/place/Mina+Zayed+-+Abu+Dhabi/@24.525283,54.3872335,14z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x3e5e66de29cbaa17:0x9830676b298225a5?hl=en">Plant Souk</a>

<a href="https://www.google.ae/maps/place/Iranian+Souk/@24.5265,54.374,15z/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x0:0xd0d461a2621fb93f?sa=X&amp;ved=0CG8Q_BIwCmoVChMI2OrTweCCyAIVyEAaCh0zEA0u">Iranian Souk</a>

<a href="https://www.google.ae/maps/place/Mina+Zayed+-+Abu+Dhabi/@24.525283,54.3872335,14z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x3e5e66de29cbaa17:0x9830676b298225a5?hl=en">Date Souk </a>

<a href="https://www.google.ae/maps/place/Foodlands+Restaurant+LLC/@24.479387,54.362825,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m2!3m1!1s0x3e5e666c83edb309:0xc9b4d9d0b7e63c12?hl=en">Foodlands</a>

<a href="https://www.zomato.com/abudhabi/al-ababeel-refreshment-madinat-zayed/menu">Al Ababeel</a>

