After the Eid al-Adha break, The Gazelle Video Desk compiled clips from NYU Abu Dhabi students who had filmed their vacations around the globe. This video shows some of their experiences traveling to near and far places, meeting different people, trying tasty cuisines and embracing the local culture.

Produced by video editors Julia Saubier, Karma Dolma Gurung and Angela Maria Orozco. Edited by Angela Maria Orozco and Karma Dolma Gurung.

Music: Firestone (Instrumental) — Kygo ft. Conrad.

