Abu Dhabi — Kai-Erik Jensen, Sofia Fernandez, Alyssa Yu, Fatih Haloglu, Kenny Song
Al Ain — Caroline Pelaez
Dubai — Alyssa Yu, Sneha Gyawali, Riva Razdan, Annalisa Galgano
Oman — Khairunisa M. Semesta 
Iran — Amer Nasr
Kyrgyzstan — Geo Kamus
Armenia — Justin Lee and Robson Beaudry
Tanzania — Ali Abou El Atta
Uganda — Imen Hadad
Malaysia — Keerthana Anna Prakash
Boston — Sachin Sahan Tampoe
New York City — Brooke Hopkins

Special thanks to Joey Bui and Zoe Hu, the rest of the Gazelle Team and student contributors.

