		<title>The Halloween Zombie Run</title>
		<link>http://localhost/?p=139481</link>
		<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2015 14:35:16 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[William Young]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://www.thegazelle.org/?p=139481</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[As campus safety is a priority at NYU Abu Dhabi, the ability of students to know how to react in the event of a zombie apocalypse is of utmost importance. In partnership with the Athletics Department, A2 Residential College held the university's first Zombie Run to kick off Halloween celebrations.

The High Line was used as a feasting ground, where brave humans attempted to evade zombie gaze while they lapped the outer edge three times, albeit not very successfully. Takeaway message: avoid the High Line when the zombies come.

[big_image]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/Screen-Shot-2015-11-01-at-3.38.49-am.png"><img class="aligncenter size-thumbnail wp-image-142271" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/Screen-Shot-2015-11-01-at-3.38.49-am-573x430.png" alt="Screen Shot 2015-11-01 at 3.38.49 am" width="573" height="430" /></a>[/big_image]

[big_image]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/Screen-Shot-2015-11-01-at-3.34.01-am.png"><img class="aligncenter size-thumbnail wp-image-142251" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/Screen-Shot-2015-11-01-at-3.34.01-am-572x430.png" alt="Screen Shot 2015-11-01 at 3.34.01 am" width="572" height="430" /></a>[/big_image]

[big_image]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/Screen-Shot-2015-11-01-at-3.39.43-am.png"><img class="aligncenter size-thumbnail wp-image-142281" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/Screen-Shot-2015-11-01-at-3.39.43-am-576x430.png" alt="Screen Shot 2015-11-01 at 3.39.43 am" width="576" height="430" /></a>[/big_image][big_image]<a href="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/IMG_4900.jpg"><img class="aligncenter size-thumbnail wp-image-142301" src="http://thegazelle.s3.amazonaws.com/gazelle/2015/10/IMG_4900-573x430.jpg" alt="IMG_4900" width="573" height="430" /></a>[/big_image]


